'''Summon Harbinger of Time''' is a [[spell]] that summons an allied Harbinger [[minion]]. The skill is only available through {{il|The Flow Untethered}}.

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summon Harbinger is immortal, and occasionally casts {{stl|The Flow Untethered}} on the player character. {{stl|The Flow Untethered}} is an [[aura]] that lasts 8 seconds, with a cooldown of 20 seconds, granting +10% [[action speed]] to the player and nearby allies and enemies:

[[Action speed]] is a modifier affecting animation speed. This effect stacks additively with other modifiers like [[Temporal Chains]] and [[chill]].

==Drop restrictions==
Harbinger of Time can only be obtained by equipping {{il|The Flow Untethered}}.
==See also==
* {{stl|Slipstream}}, a similar ground effect
* {{sl|Summon Greater Harbinger of Time}}, the greater Harbinger version of the skill

